WEBVTT

00:00:00.445 --> 00:00:04.673
Open a ground floor PDF. Set the scale using the 10 m dimension and measure the living room.

00:00:04.673 --> 00:00:08.143
Create a private drawing project and add the saved ground floor. Its scale, posts and measured area follow the drawing.

00:00:08.143 --> 00:00:12.540
Add the upper floor as a separate document. Its 5 m dimension gives a different scale. Mark the study and its two posts.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:16.858
Across both floors the saved marks total 25 m², 7.5 m of wall and three posts. Expand a drawing to check its own reference and quantities.

00:00:16.858 --> 00:00:20.212
Issue the current project revision in Project Summary. The report keeps a copy of the quantities and each drawing revision.

00:00:20.212 --> 00:00:24.513
Read the appendix in the browser. Reopen the issued report to check each sheet, even after later edits to the project.
